<title>UK: Telkom at $34.5 in London.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $34.5 in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at $34.5 in London on Wednesday. It recorded the day's low of $33.4 and the day's high of $34.5.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Tuesday as $33.375.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364.</p>
</text>
